      "text": "Revision 1.8 | 2026-11-12 | A1/022 connects ifm PN2070 B2 OUT2 to CPU AI0 and links supply/common.",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-023-title",
      "sheetId": "ref-023",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 54,
      "text": "A1/023 · PN2070 to CPU AI0 analog scaling reference",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-023-cpu-range",
      "sheetId": "ref-023",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 125,
      "text": "CPU 1212C AI0 / X11:2 · 0–10 V rated range · raw value 0–27648 (Siemens Table A-41).",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-023-load",
      "sheetId": "ref-023",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 205,
      "text": "CPU analog input impedance ≥100 kΩ; PN2070 OUT2 voltage output minimum load ≥2 kΩ.",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-023-device",
      "sheetId": "ref-023",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 285,
      "text": "Configure B2 OUT2 to voltage (ou2 = U); verify the active ASP2 / AEP2 endpoints and output span at the device.",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-023-normalize",
      "sheetId": "ref-023",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 365,
      "text": "For the rated CPU range: normalized input = AI0raw / 27648, where 0 V → 0 and 10 V → 27648.",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-023-scale",
      "sheetId": "ref-023",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 445,
      "text": "Conditional pressure relation for a verified 0–10 V span: P = ASP2 + (AI0raw / 27648) × (AEP2 − ASP2).",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-023-implement",
      "sheetId": "ref-023",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 525,
      "text": "Siemens describes normalizing then scaling analog values; use NORM_X / SCALE_X or an equivalent validated implementation.",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-023-accuracy",
      "sheetId": "ref-023",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 605,
      "text": "CPU 1212C AI: 10-bit resolution; stated accuracy 3.0% FS at 25 °C / 3.5% FS over −20…60 °C; no uncertainty budget is assigned.",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-023-limit",
      "sheetId": "ref-023",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 675,
      "text": "No active PLC block, process point, ASP2/AEP2 values, calibration, alarms, or commissioned pressure scale is defined by this reference.",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-023-source",
      "sheetId": "ref-023",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 735,
      "text": "Sources: Siemens S7-1200 System Manual V4.7, Table A-41 and §6.3; ifm PN2070 data sheet / programming guide.",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-002-line-22",
      "sheetId": "ref-002",
      "x": 120,
      "y": 1630,
      "text": "A1/023  PN2070 → CPU AI0 analog scaling reference",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-004-line-14",
      "sheetId": "ref-004",
      "x": 120,
      "y": 1520,
      "text": "Revision 1.9 | 2026-11-13 | A1/023 records conditional PN2070 / CPU AI0 scaling; no endpoints or PLC logic assigned.",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-024-title",
      "sheetId": "ref-024",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 54,
      "text": "A1/024 · PN2070 24 V DC load allocation reference",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-024-supply",
      "sheetId": "ref-024",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 135,
      "text": "Siemens SITOP PSU100C 6EP1332-5BA00 · 24 V DC · rated 2.5 A through +50 °C; 0.75 A at +70 °C.",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-024-tolerance",
      "sheetId": "ref-024",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 215,
      "text": "PSU static output tolerance ±3% gives 23.28–24.72 V at nominal 24 V, within PN2070's listed 18–30 V DC range (before wiring drop).",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-024-sensor",
      "sheetId": "ref-024",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 295,
      "text": "PN2070 B2 current consumption is <35 mA; at 24 V nominal this branch is <0.84 W.",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-024-share",
      "sheetId": "ref-024",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 375,
      "text": "B2 alone is <1.4% of the 2.5 A rating through +50 °C; at +70 °C it is <4.67% of the 0.75 A derated rating.",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-024-bound",
      "sheetId": "ref-024",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 465,
      "text": "This compares only B2 with the PSU rating. CPU, relays, contactor coils, other loads, startup demand and wiring drop are not subtracted.",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-024-limits",
      "sheetId": "ref-024",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 555,
      "text": "No total load, ambient profile, protection coordination, conductor sizing, transient margin or supply adequacy is established.",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-024-commissioning",
      "sheetId": "ref-024",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 645,
      "text": "Confirm installed PSU variant, ambient derating, measured 24 V at B2 and actual sensor current before release.",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-024-source",
      "sheetId": "ref-024",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 735,
      "text": "Sources: Siemens SITOP PSU100C Operating Instructions / product data; ifm PN2070-02 data sheet.",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-002-line-23",
      "sheetId": "ref-002",
      "x": 120,
      "y": 1685,
      "text": "A1/024  PN2070 B2 supply-current allocation vs SITOP PSU rating",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-004-line-15",
      "sheetId": "ref-004",
      "x": 120,
      "y": 1574,
      "text": "Revision 2.0 | 2026-11-13 | A1/024 compares B2 <35 mA against the SITOP rating; total supply load remains unassessed.",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-025-title",
      "sheetId": "ref-025",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 54,
      "text": "A1/025 · PN2070 / CPU AI0 conditional accuracy reference",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-025-condition",
      "sheetId": "ref-025",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 125,
      "text": "Conditional 0–400 bar case only: verify OUT2 = U, ASP2 = 0 bar and AEP2 = 400 bar; CPU AI0 is 0–10 V.",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-025-ifm",
      "sheetId": "ref-025",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 215,
      "text": "ifm PN2070 characteristic deviation at limit setting, 1:1 span: <±0.5% → <±2 bar over 400 bar.",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-025-cpu",
      "sheetId": "ref-025",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 305,
      "text": "Siemens CPU 1212C AI accuracy: 3.0% FS at 25 °C / 3.5% FS over −20…60 °C → ±12 / ±14 bar.",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-025-stack",
      "sheetId": "ref-025",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 405,
      "text": "Arithmetic sum of those stated contributions: <±14 bar at 25 °C; <±16 bar over the CPU temperature range.",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-025-scope",
      "sheetId": "ref-025",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 495,
      "text": "This is a conditional partial error stack, not a complete uncertainty budget, measured result or accuracy guarantee.",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-025-exclusions",
      "sheetId": "ref-025",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 585,
      "text": "Other sensor deviations, calibration, wiring noise, installation effects and any actual ASP2/AEP2 values are not included.",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-025-verify",
      "sheetId": "ref-025",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 675,
      "text": "Confirm sensor mode, endpoints, CPU range and temperature before applying the conversion; no live setting is assumed.",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-025-source",
      "sheetId": "ref-025",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 745,
      "text": "Sources: ifm PN2070-02 data sheet, Accuracy / deviations; Siemens S7-1200 System Manual V4.7, Table A-41.",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-026-title",
      "sheetId": "ref-026",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 54,
      "text": "A1/026 · CPU 1212C AI0 idealized resolution reference",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-026-condition",
      "sheetId": "ref-026",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 125,
      "text": "Conditional illustration only: verify PN2070 OUT2 = U and a linear 0–400 bar / 0–10 V span; CPU AI0 is rated 0–10 V.",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-026-resolution",
      "sheetId": "ref-026",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 215,
      "text": "Siemens CPU 1212C Table A-41 specifies 10-bit analog-input resolution over the 0–10 V rated range.",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-026-code-step",
      "sheetId": "ref-026",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 305,
      "text": "Ideal uniform code interval: 10 V / 2^10 = 9.765625 mV; mapped 400 bar / 2^10 = 0.390625 bar per interval.",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-026-quantization",
      "sheetId": "ref-026",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 405,
      "text": "Ideal rounding quantization alone would be ±0.1953125 bar (half an interval); this is derived, not a Siemens accuracy specification.",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-026-raw-word",
      "sheetId": "ref-026",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 495,
      "text": "The 0–27648 PLC data-word scaling is a representation of rated full scale; it does not imply 15-bit analog resolution.",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-026-scope",
      "sheetId": "ref-026",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 585,
      "text": "This idealization excludes effective resolution, noise, smoothing configuration, sensor deviation, calibration and field measurements.",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-026-accuracy-context",
      "sheetId": "ref-026",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 675,
      "text": "The ideal half-step is much smaller than the CPU's published ±14 bar full-scale accuracy contribution over its rated temperature range.",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-026-source",
      "sheetId": "ref-026",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 745,
      "text": "Source: Siemens S7-1200 System Manual V4.7 (12/2024), CPU 1212C Table A-41.",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-027-title",
      "sheetId": "ref-027",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 54,
      "text": "A1/027 · CPU 1212C AI0 response and smoothing reference",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-027-source-condition",
      "sheetId": "ref-027",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 125,
      "text": "Siemens Table A-42 gives built-in CPU analog-input 0–10 V step response measured at 95%; no smoothing setting is selected here.",
      "stroke": "#13263b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "id": "doc-ref-027-sample-time",
      "sheetId": "ref-027",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 205,
